-- DraftPunk: the style guide (BJCP 2021 beer, BJCP 2015 mead and cider) with each style's OG, FG, IBU, SRM and ABV
-- ranges, so a recipe can point at its style (dp_recipes.style_id). The app's own copy is lib/draftpunk/styles.ts.
on conflict (id) do update set name = excluded.name, guide = excluded.guide, data = excluded.data;
